message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Compiled World Runtime"
abstract: >-
  The Compiled World Runtime (CWR) turns an agent harness into a frozen, rule-governed world:
  a human-edited World Source is compiled into an immutable, content-addressed Build, a kernel
  runs sandboxed turns through atomic primitives whose outcomes depend only on visible
  conditions, and the only path to a different world is a human recompilation into a new,
  versioned and announced Build.
